Description: XLibre X server -- Nouveau display driver
 This driver for the XLibre X server (see xserver-xlibre for a further description)
 provides support for NVIDIA Riva, TNT, GeForce, and Quadro cards.
 .
 This package provides 2D support including EXA acceleration, Xv and
 RandR.  3D functionality is provided by the libgl1-mesa-dri package.
 .
 This package is built from the XLibre xf86-video-nouveau driver.
